[{"client_msg_id":"59542233-DC62-4001-BBEC-5B71D8838846","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"動的にqfに追加してるから発生する不具合であって、要素取得のみを非同期にして、qfの構築は同期的に一発で行えば悩む必要がなさそうです","ts":"1617455689.074300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yI/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1BFDA850-A84B-4B58-93F7-9A6BF5B4D306","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"これ、そもそもの要望を考えると、個別に追加ではなく構築後に一発で追加して、そのあとあFinをひらくだけで良いのでは？","ts":"1617455587.072000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EH1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"664d4d81-b4ef-44f1-97b1-d09e0e4f2396","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"FFっぽい","ts":"1617455445.070100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"foL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9b710b8a-4e9b-4df8-a112-db2727a13a06","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"最後に出てきたのがqf/loclistだと、ジャンプが簡単、みたいなのはありますけど...期待するところかによりますね","ts":"1617455394.069900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vv7Mq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"24465AE1-8949-4007-87B7-9D54CC88BDDB","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"ですです。で、その場合qfを使う意味は？と個人的には思います。","ts":"1617455276.069300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PSu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d5b07836-5418-4e5c-b372-e29887841ff1","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"たぶん、qfに対してそれぞれが非同期やると厳しいから、 source -\u0026gt; filter -\u0026gt; qflist(add)みたいになる動作が作れないと期待動作にはならなそう?","ts":"1617455203.068200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ihlB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"AF81D2F6-9ED9-43BE-AD67-B7B49FD60F83","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"qfを使う時点で、かなり厳しそうです","ts":"1617455077.067100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/0vb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"07BDD18D-C118-4757-823E-BC7B038FAB85","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"非同期に追加しながら非同期にフィルターしたいという話でしょうか？その場合、フィルター部分も自前で作成しないと難しいかと","ts":"1617455059.066700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vzSL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3b85afc9-0a16-4a4a-93a9-dafde7c43258","type":"message","user":"UEX9VPSET","text":"\u003c@U776661HA\u003e\n[yukimemi/dps-asyngrep](\u003chttps://github.com/yukimemi/dps-asyngrep\u003e) で、非同期に結果を quickfix に出してるんですが、これを ctrlp とか coclist みたいなんで絞り込むことはできないでしょうか？\n[lambdalisue/fin.vim: :fish: Filter the buffer content in-place without modification](\u003chttps://github.com/lambdalisue/fin.vim\u003e) これ使えないかなぁーとか思ったんですが、 denops で非同期に setqflist して quickfix が動的に増えていくのに追従して filter かけていくのができなくて・・・。(Fin 打った瞬間の quickfix list で固定化されて増えていかない。)","ts":"1617448733.065200","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: yukimemi/dps-asyngrep","id":1,"title":"yukimemi/dps-asyngrep","title_link":"https://github.com/yukimemi/dps-asyngrep","text":"Contribute to yukimemi/dps-asyngrep development by creating an account on GitHub.","thumb_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6442108?s=400\u0026v=4","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","thumb_width":400,"thumb_height":400,"from_url":"https://github.com/yukimemi/dps-asyngrep","original_url":"https://github.com/yukimemi/dps-asyngrep"},{"fallback":"GitHub: lambdalisue/fin.vim","id":2,"title":"lambdalisue/fin.vim","title_link":"https://github.com/lambdalisue/fin.vim","text":":fish: Filter the buffer content in-place without modification - lambdalisue/fin.vim","thumb_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/546312?s=400\u0026v=4","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","thumb_width":400,"thumb_height":400,"from_url":"https: